  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ECOP delivery through Global Development Delivery (GDD) framework</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To provide support for a 3-year programme which will help India to implement its proposed economic reforms, alongside climate and infrastructure development priorities, with a view to support its long-term growth objectives. It will provide expertise and support, primarily to Ministry of Finance, with some assistance expected to be provided to a small number of state governments and other Indian agencies.  The programme will engage in areas where the UK is well-placed to make the greatest strategic impact: (i) private finance and reforms to the business environment; (ii) public finance; and (iii) high quality, low carbon, and resilient infrastructure/strengthened business environment.</narrative>
  </description>
